      "source": "<a href=\"../ServletWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.servlet.context\"><code>ServletWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> that accepts annotated classes as input - in\nparticular <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/Configuration.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>@Configuration</code></a>\n-annotated classes, but also plain <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/stereotype/Component.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.stereotype\"><code>@Component</code></a> classes and JSR-330\ncompliant classes using <code>javax.inject</code> annotations.",
